📝 Complete README for Task 6 - Pakistan House Price Prediction
🏠 Pakistan House Price Prediction
📌 Project Overview
This project is part of the AI/ML Engineering Internship at DevelopersHub Corporation. The objective is to predict house prices in Pakistan using property features such as size, bedrooms, bathrooms, and location.

🎯 Objective
Build a high-accuracy regression model to predict property prices across major Pakistani cities (Karachi, Lahore, Islamabad, Rawalpindi, Faisalabad) using machine learning techniques.

📊 Dataset Overview
Source: Zameen.com / Kaggle Pakistani Property Dataset

Total Records: 168,446 properties

Original Features: 18 features

Engineered Features: 30+ features

Target Variable: price (Property price in PKR)

