📈 Methodology
1. Data Preprocessing
Handled missing values in agency and agent columns (26% missing)

Filled with mode: 'Real Investment Consultants' and 'Boez Ayub'

Converted area to square feet (already in sq ft in this dataset)

Encoded categorical variables using LabelEncoder:

property_type (7 unique values)

city (5 unique values: Karachi, Lahore, Islamabad, Rawalpindi, Faisalabad)

province_name (3 unique values)

purpose (2 unique values: For Sale, For Rent)

location (1,509 unique values)

Removed outliers (8.04% of data identified as price outliers)

2. Feature Engineering
Created powerful new features to capture Pakistani real estate dynamics:

Feature	Description
area_sqft	Area in square feet
price_per_sqft	Price per square foot (most important feature)
bath_per_bedroom	Bathroom to bedroom ratio
area_per_bedroom	Square feet per bedroom
total_rooms	Total rooms (bedrooms + bathrooms)
location_density	Number of properties in same location
city_price_tier	City price category (Low/Medium/High)
property_type_popularity	How common the property type is
log_price	Log-transformed price
log_area	Log-transformed area
price_bin	10 price categories
bedrooms_x_area	Interaction feature
baths_x_area	Interaction feature
