4. Model Training
Trained multiple regression models with hyperparameter tuning:

Model	R² Score	MAE (Million PKR)	Training Time
Gradient Boosting	0.9928 (99.28%)	0.53	242.68s
XGBoost	0.9697 (96.97%)	1.01	7.48s
Random Forest	0.9671 (96.71%)	0.64	101.05s
Extra Trees	0.9571 (95.71%)	1.33	52.82s
Stacking Ensemble	0.9925 (99.25%)	0.68	226.39s
5. Hyperparameter Optimization
Used RandomizedSearchCV with:

30% sample for faster tuning

2-fold cross-validation

8 parameter combinations per model

Best Parameters for Gradient Boosting:
n_estimators: 200

max_depth: 7

learning_rate: 0.1

min_samples_split: 10

