💡 Business Recommendations
For INVESTORS: Focus on area (size) and city location for best returns. Properties in Lahore command premium prices.

For BUYERS: Use price per sq ft to compare properties across different sizes - this is the most important predictor.

For DEVELOPERS: Bedroom and bathroom configurations significantly impact value. Properties with 3-5 bedrooms are most popular.

For AGENTS: This model provides instant, data-driven price estimates with 99.3% accuracy within ±5 Million PKR.

For BANKS: Use for more accurate property valuation for mortgages with 88% accuracy within ±1 Million PKR.

